---
// Our Way / ways of working (Kedar's design, MacBook Air - 19, 2026-10-30): hero, two portrait cards
// (shorter than before), "Check out what we have done" ghost button.
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import Actions from '../components/Actions.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import PortraitCard from '../components/PortraitCard.astro';
import { routes, labels } from '../data/site';
import hitchcock from '../assets/wow/hitchcock.png';
import wongKarWai from '../assets/wow/wong-kar-wai.png';
---
<BaseLayout title="Our way" description="There are just 2 ways of working. We are fine either way. Be it building digital products, making a film or cooking dinner.">
  <Hero
    title="There are just 2 ways of working. We are fine either way."
    lead="Be it building digital products, making a film or cooking dinner."
    bigLead
  >
    <Actions primary={{ label: labels.exploreWhatWeDo, href: routes.services }} />
  </Hero>

  <div class="container page">
    <section class="stack" aria-label="Two ways of working">
      <PortraitCard
        image={hitchcock}
        alt="Alfred Hitchcock, finger to his lips"
        name="Alfred Hitchcock"
        role="Filmmaker"
        heading="Meticulous planning"
        side="left"
        tilt
      >
        Hitchcock mapped out every shot, sequence, script detail, and technical continuity before filming began. The actual shooting was simply a matter of execution.
      </PortraitCard>

      <PortraitCard
        image={wongKarWai}
        alt="Wong Kar-wai in sunglasses, smiling"
        name="Wong Kar-wai"
        role="Filmmaker"
        heading="Creative Improvisation"
        side="right"
        tilt
      >
        Wong Kar-wai often began filming without a finished script, developing scenes and dialogue as he went. More organic way of exploring as we go embracing the ambiguity.
      </PortraitCard>
    </section>

    <div class="actions"><Button href={routes.workList} variant="ghost">{labels.checkOutWork}</Button></div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page { padding-bottom: var(--rhythm-section); }
  .stack { display: grid; gap: var(--rhythm-card-gap); }
  .actions { display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-top: var(--rhythm-team-heading); }
</style>
